    {
      "type": "tweet",
      "id": "1960356978150256843",
      "url": "https://x.com/laiteranidaddy/status/1960356978150256843",
      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/laiteranidaddy/status/1960356978150256843",
      "text": "Inday Sara’s Way: Technicalities Over Truth\n\nWhether it’s defending her father in The Hague or protecting herself in Manila, Sara Duterte only knows one tactic: escape through technicality, never through truth. Kasi kapag totoo ang basehan, talo siya. Kaya ang palusot: legal. Hindi moral. Hindi factual.\n\n1. ICC: Her Father’s Arrest Proves the Case Is Real: Defense Proves She's Desperate\n\nSince March 2025, Rodrigo Duterte has been under arrest and detained sa The Hague, charged with crimes against humanity.\nAlam ng lahat kung sino ang isa sa nagdidikta sa kampo niya: Sara Duterte.\nBehind the scenes, she’s the strategist. She’s the real power. Why? Dahil gamit na gamit niya ang nangyari sa Tatay niya para sa ambisyon nya sa 2028 Presidential elections. \n\nInstead of facing the facts , like the sworn testimonies of whistleblowers including Arturo Lascañas and several victims. anong ginawa nila?\n\nThey challenged jurisdiction. They questioned process. They filed motions para palitan ang judges o ang prosecutors. Why? Because even Sara knows: “Masyado nang malakas ang ebidensya. Kailangan tumagal ang proseso upang mai-load niya sa victim card niya ang nangyayari sa tatay nya. \n\nSimple lang, if mahina ang ebidensya laban kay Duterte, dapat hindi nagdedelay ang kampo nya. Ang mga motions at pagkontra sa korte ay maaaring magpabagal sa proseso ng paglilitis.\n\n2. Impeachment: noong siya naman ang nasa sitwasyon, Tumatakbo rin Siya sa Technicality\n\nNung siya naman ang nabanatan ng impeachment complaint dito sa Pilipinas, Sara pulled exactly the same move. Walang sagot. Walang paliwanag. Instead, she ran to the Supreme Court to block the process. At inutusan ang kanyang mga kampon sa senado na i-delay at tuluyang harangin ang impeachment trial. \n\nAt syempre, sino ang nasa Supreme Court?\nMajority appointees ni Rodrigo Duterte.\n\nGuess what happened?\nShe got what she wanted. The case was killed not with facts, but with connections.\n\nSenators aligned with Duterte defended her, no questions asked. Because that’s the strategy: Control the institutions. Evade the truth. Hold on power hanggang 2028. \n\n3. One Pattern. One Sara. Zero Integrity.\n• In the ICC: the Duterte camp avoids facts by attacking the court.\n• In the impeachment: she avoids accountability by blocking the process.\n• In both cases: she doesn’t defend innocence. She defends privilege and This is cowardice in high heels.\n\n4. The gly Truth: Sara is Not Fighting for Justice. She’s Fighting to Survive.\nWhen her father is in jail, when her own name is under fire, when truth threatens her name, anong ginawa niya? \nSheweaponize technicalities.\nShe manipulate institutions.\nShe act like a victim while silencing the real ones.\nAnd worse, she make it look legal, even if it’s morally bankrupt.\n\n5. Same Sara, Same Script\nNo https://t.co/7wICJp0rx7 courage. Walang hiya. \n\nThe more she hides behind technicalities, the more obvious the guilt.\n\nBottomline:\nSara Duterte doesn’t face accusations with truth she buries them with technivalities and connections. And in both The Hague and the House of Representatives, the truth keeps knocking: but she keeps running.",
